      "text" : "{\"schemaVersion\":\"1.8\",\"facts\":[{\"factId\":\"f1\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0012\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0014\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0016\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0018\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0020\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0032\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0048\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0052\"],\"questionIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0011\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0013\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0015\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0017\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0019\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0021\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0025\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0028\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0030\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0033\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0035\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0045\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0050\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0053\"],\"answerIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0012\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0014\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0016\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0018\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0020\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0032\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0048\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0052\"],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"왼쪽 귀 청력이 전보다 나빠졌고, 6주 정도 지속되었으며, 간헐적 왼쪽 이명과 몇 차례의 경미한 메스꺼움/어지러움이 동반됨\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f2\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0016\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0018\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0020\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0022\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0029\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0036\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0048\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"약 1년 전에도 비슷한 청력 저하가 있었지만 며칠만 지속되었음\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[\"HISTORICAL\"]},{\"factId\":\"f3\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0037\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0038\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0040\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0041\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0055\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0056\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0057\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"귀지 같은 단순한 원인을 먼저 확인해야 하며, 귀 안과 고막을 봐야 함\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f4\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0042\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0043\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0044\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0070\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0074\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"4~5일 안에 대면 진료를 받고, 예약은 지원팀에 전화해 잡음\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"OTHER\",\"title\":\"대면 진료 예약\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f5\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0076\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"진료 전에 문제가 생기면 다른 화상 진료를 예약해 상담하라고 안내함\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"OTHER\",\"title\":\"화상 진료 상담\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[\"UNCLEAR_SUBJECT\"]},{\"factId\":\"f6\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0065\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0069\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"대면 진료 전까지 이명 안내 자료 링크를 읽어 보라고 함\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"CLINICIAN_ONLY\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f7\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0037\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"PRECAUTION\",\"text\":\"면봉으로 귀를 청소하지 말라고 안내함\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f8\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0059\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0061\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0063\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0068\"],\"questionIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0058\"],\"answerIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0059\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0061\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0063\",\"s5bb533f54674v1u0068\"],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"귀에서 나는 소리는 이명(tinnitus)이며, 원인은 여러 가지일 수 있고 완전히 이해되지 않은 부분이 있음\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f9\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s5bb533f54674v1u0048\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"어지러움은 심하지 않고, 방이 도는 회전성 어지럼이 아니라 균형이 조금 안 맞는 느낌임\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]}],\"summaryFactIds\":[\"f1\",\"f4\",\"f8\",\"f3\",\"f7\",\"f5\"]}"
